{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "star-one-sso-collection-v3",
    "name": "Star One SSO API Collection (Skillmine + Legacy Hub)",
    "description": "# Star One SSO API Collection\n\nComplete Single Sign-On (SSO) test collection for Star One API.\n\n## Structure:\n1. **Skillmine OAuth2 Authentication** (Production flow)\n   - `GET /v1/auth/skillmine/login-url`\n   - `POST /v1/auth/callback` (Auto-saves `auth_token`)\n   - `POST /v1/auth/logout`\n2. **Local Standalone OTP Authentication** (Local mock flow)\n   - `POST /v1/sso/send-otp` (Auto-captures `test_otp`)\n   - `POST /v1/sso/verify-otp` (Auto-saves `auth_token`)\n3. **Product Launch Hand-offs**\n   - `POST /v1/sso/launch/star_saathi`\n   - `POST /v1/sso/launch/star_sfa`\n   - `POST /v1/sso/launch/star_link`\n   - `POST /v1/sso/launch/star_steller`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "auth_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "test_otp",
      "value": "1234"
    },
    {
      "key": "test_mobile",
      "value": "9000000004"
    },
    {
      "key": "skillmine_code",
      "value": "sample_auth_code_from_skillmine"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Skillmine OAuth2 Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Get Skillmine Hosted Login URL",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/skillmine/login-url?state=test_state_123",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "skillmine",
                "login-url"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "state",
                  "value": "test_state_123"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 Skillmine Callback (Code Exchange -> StarOne JWT)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.star_one_session_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('auth_token', res.star_one_session_token);",
                  "    console.log('StarOne JWT Session Token saved:', res.star_one_session_token);",
                  "}",
                  "if (res.skillmine_access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('skillmine_access_token', res.skillmine_access_token);",
                  "    console.log('Skillmine Access Token saved:', res.skillmine_access_token);",
                  "}",
                  "if (res.skillmine_id_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('skillmine_id_token', res.skillmine_id_token);",
                  "    console.log('Skillmine ID Token saved:', res.skillmine_id_token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"{{skillmine_code}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/callback",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "callback"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 Federated Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"access_token\": \"{{skillmine_access_token}}\",\n  \"id_token\": \"{{skillmine_id_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Local Standalone OTP Flow (Mock / Offline)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 Send OTP (Local)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.debug_otp) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('test_otp', res.debug_otp);",
                  "    console.log('Captured debug_otp:', res.debug_otp);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobile_number\": \"{{test_mobile}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/sso/send-otp",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "sso",
                "send-otp"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 Verify OTP (Local -> Saves Token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.star_one_session_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('auth_token', res.star_one_session_token);",
                  "    console.log('StarOne JWT Session Token saved:', res.star_one_session_token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobile_number\": \"{{test_mobile}}\",\n  \"otp\": \"{{test_otp}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/sso/verify-otp",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "sso",
                "verify-otp"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Product Launch Hand-offs",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "3.1 Launch Star Saathi (AES-128 Hex)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"device_id\": \"DEV_ANDROID_101\",\n  \"registration_id\": \"fcm_token_from_mobile_app\",\n  \"device_type\": \"ANDROID\",\n  \"app_version\": \"6.0\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/sso/launch/star_saathi",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "sso",
                "launch",
                "star_saathi"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.2 Launch Star SFA (XML Recordset)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/xml"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"device_id\": \"DEV_SFA_101\",\n  \"registration_id\": \"fcm_token_from_mobile_app\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/sso/launch/star_sfa",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "sso",
                "launch",
                "star_sfa"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.3 Launch Star Link (JSON + Native Token)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"device_type\": \"ANDROID\",\n  \"device_name\": \"Samsung Galaxy S22\",\n  \"app_version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"fcm_token\": \"fcm_token_from_mobile_app\",\n  \"preferred_app_lang\": \"en\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/sso/launch/star_link",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "sso",
                "launch",
                "star_link"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.4 Launch Star Stellar (Engineer JSON)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"device_id\": \"DEV_STELLAR_101\",\n  \"registration_id\": \"fcm_token_from_mobile_app\",\n  \"device_type\": \"ANDROID\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/sso/launch/star_steller",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "sso",
                "launch",
                "star_steller"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}